      <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Generado por morfeo jmeter a partir de profile.json (4 estados) y endpoints.json (bank-api-stress.jar). Modo curve, factor 20, cola 144 s, semilla 42. Propiedades: protocol, host, port, run_prefix, pool_prefix, create_pool, seed, connect_timeout, response_timeout.</stringProp>
